</section>

<section class="legal-section">
  <h2>2. Accounts</h2>
  <p>You need a verified email (or a linked Google/GitHub account) to use the platform. You're responsible for keeping your login credentials safe and for anything that happens under your account. Don't share accounts or let someone else deploy bots on your behalf without your knowledge.</p>
</section>

<section class="legal-section">
  <h2>3. Coins and payment</h2>
